{"schemaVersion":1,"id":24,"sections":[{"id":"111007-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[770],"start":0,"count":13},{"id":"111007-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10760],"start":13,"count":8},{"id":"111008-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[780],"start":21,"count":26},{"id":"111008-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10770],"start":47,"count":12},{"id":"111009-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[790],"start":59,"count":15},{"id":"111009-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10780],"start":74,"count":11}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:2","scriptId":770,"text":"“怎么样，还算顺利吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:3","scriptId":770,"text":"“恩，从现在的情况看来，战斗力方面不需要特别担心，茜罗娅和卓娅的加入大大增加了队伍的整体实力。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:4","scriptId":770,"text":"“那是当然，不枉我专程写了信把她们从部队中抽调出来……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:5","scriptId":770,"text":"“我总觉得有作弊嫌疑……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":214,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:6","scriptId":770,"text":"“军演代表了学院的实力，前两次伏龙芝已经两次败给了桑赫斯特。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":214,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:7","scriptId":770,"text":"“原来是这样……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":214,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:8","scriptId":770,"text":"“那个傻丘的嘴脸已经要翘到天上去了，这次一定要给她点颜色瞧瞧！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":216,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:9","scriptId":770,"text":"“‘傻丘’……那是谁？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":216,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":218,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:10","scriptId":770,"text":"“桑赫斯特的教官--伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔，和我共事过一段时间。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":218,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:11","scriptId":770,"text":"“话说桑赫斯特的小队应该明天就会到了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:12","scriptId":770,"text":"“那么快？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:13","scriptId":770,"text":"“要公平嘛，虽然是我们主场，但也不拒绝对手的事前侦察～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-PROLOGUE:770:14","scriptId":770,"text":"（公平……吗？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:1","scriptId":10760,"text":"“那么今天就先到这里，大家先回会议室吧，索菲亚教官有话要说。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:2","scriptId":10760,"text":"“好的，收队！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:6","scriptId":10760,"text":"伏龙芝会议室----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:7","scriptId":10760,"text":"“明天桑赫斯特学院的先行部队就会到了，她们是来勘察地形的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":211,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":33,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:8","scriptId":10760,"text":"“那么要好好招待她们了吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":211,"right":33,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":221,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:9","scriptId":10760,"text":"“恩，是要‘好好招待她们’。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":221,"right":33,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:10","scriptId":10760,"text":"“佐伊，你的招待和教官的招待应该不是一个意思……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":33,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111007-EPILOGUE:10760:11","scriptId":10760,"text":"“是吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:2","scriptId":780,"text":"一大清早，我们就整列等候在伏龙芝正门。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:3","scriptId":780,"text":"“怎么还没来……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":221,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:4","scriptId":780,"text":"“贵族们一般都比较拖沓啦。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":221,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:6","scriptId":780,"text":"话音刚落就听到远处传来引擎的声音。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:7","scriptId":780,"text":"“看来是到了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:9","scriptId":780,"text":"一阵沙尘过后，几个身影出现在众人面前。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":289,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:10","scriptId":780,"text":"“哟～索菲亚好久不见啊，希望这次军演不会让我觉得太无聊啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":null,"right":289,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":219,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:11","scriptId":780,"text":"“怎么可能～这次军演可不比从前了，伊莎贝尔。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":219,"right":289,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:12","scriptId":780,"text":"“希望如此，今天主要先带负责侦查的队员来勘察一下地形。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":219,"right":283,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":259,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:13","scriptId":780,"text":"“我是丹妮丝·奥金莱克，这次军演小队的副队长。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":259,"right":283,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:14","scriptId":780,"text":"“利薇尔·霍伯特。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":259,"right":271,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:15","scriptId":780,"text":"“大家好，我是塞姬·艾恩赛德，负责侦查～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":298,"right":271,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:16","scriptId":780,"text":"（啊，该轮到我了，自我介绍自我介绍……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":298,"right":41,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:17","scriptId":780,"text":"“啊，那个……我是佐伊·谢尔曼----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":298,"right":31,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":269,"speaker":"丹妮丝·奥金莱克","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:18","scriptId":780,"text":"“嘛，介绍就这样吧，反正听不听都一样，比起这个我更想早点去看下军演的场地。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":269,"right":31,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":271,"speaker":"利薇尔·霍伯特","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:19","scriptId":780,"text":"“完全同意。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":269,"right":271,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:20","scriptId":780,"text":"“那就先去吧～场地的位置都已经在给你们的地图上标记好了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":283,"right":271,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:21","scriptId":780,"text":"丹妮丝和利薇尔向着伊莎贝尔行了个礼就自顾自的离开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":283,"right":271,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:22","scriptId":780,"text":"（诶？这是什么情况？？)","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":283,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":298,"speaker":"塞姬·艾恩赛德","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:23","scriptId":780,"text":"“抱歉啦，丹妮丝和利薇尔就是那个样子，不好意思啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":298,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:24","scriptId":780,"text":"说完，塞姬也追着丹妮丝和利薇尔离开了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":298,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:25","scriptId":780,"text":"……………谁都没料到会是这样的情况，除了索菲亚教官。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":298,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":212,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:26","scriptId":780,"text":"“桑赫斯特的学生真是一如既往的不懂礼数，还好意思称自己是贵族～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":212,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:27","scriptId":780,"text":"“NO、NO，这才是强者应有的架势嘛～不觉得很棒吗～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":212,"right":291,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":221,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:28","scriptId":780,"text":"“哼哼，我们走着瞧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":221,"right":291,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-PROLOGUE:780:29","scriptId":780,"text":"（我大概知道索菲亚教官非赢不可的原因了……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":291,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:1","scriptId":10770,"text":"尴尬的迎接会以后，两位教官往会议室去了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:2","scriptId":10770,"text":"留下我们一堆人傻站在校门口……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:3","scriptId":10770,"text":"“桑赫斯特学院以前就是这样的吗？我在校的时候从来没接触过。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":41,"right":291,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:4","scriptId":10770,"text":"“吊车尾怎么可能见过～这些都是精英。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":41,"right":81,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:5","scriptId":10770,"text":"“那就是说我现在也是精英了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":37,"right":81,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":88,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:6","scriptId":10770,"text":"“……大概是吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":37,"right":88,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:7","scriptId":10770,"text":"“桑赫斯特学院的恃才傲物之前有所耳闻，见过以后确实如此。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":88,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":172,"speaker":"卓娅·朱可娃","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:8","scriptId":10770,"text":"“看上去似乎是有那么点实力～索菲亚叫我们来的理由我大概了解了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":103,"right":172,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:9","scriptId":10770,"text":"“确实……和现役的比还是嫩了点，教官的意思应该就是让我们打击下她们的气焰吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":172,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:10","scriptId":10770,"text":"“那我们接下来干什么呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":3,"right":92,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":356,"speaker":"茜罗娅·约德尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:11","scriptId":10770,"text":"“要不我们去看看桑赫斯特的表现～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":356,"right":92,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111008-EPILOGUE:10770:12","scriptId":10770,"text":"“恩，反正基本磨合已经差不多了，就当侦察下敌情～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-090.webp","left":356,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:2","scriptId":790,"text":"另一方面，伏龙芝会议室----","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":356,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:3","scriptId":790,"text":"“这就是这次请来的特邀嘉宾，死水的沙狐小队。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:4","scriptId":790,"text":"“你们好，我是伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔，桑赫斯特皇家学院的教官～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":211,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:5","scriptId":790,"text":"“我是蕾贝卡·隆美尔，沙狐小队队长。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:6","scriptId":790,"text":"“沙狐小队在北非的事迹让人印象深刻。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:7","scriptId":790,"text":"“过奖了。旁边这两位是我的部下露米娜·施泰特和雷娅·古德里安。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":247,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:8","scriptId":790,"text":"“恩，叫我雷娅就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":247,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":235,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:9","scriptId":790,"text":"“你好，我是露米娜·施泰特。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":235,"right":283,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:10","scriptId":790,"text":"“那这次的裁判任务就有劳几位了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":235,"right":291,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":291,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:11","scriptId":790,"text":"“比起和伏龙芝的军演，我更希望直接和沙狐小队切磋一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":235,"right":291,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":221,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:12","scriptId":790,"text":"“这句话我可不能当没听见啊，主次不分可不是教官应有的行为哟。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":221,"right":291,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":293,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:13","scriptId":790,"text":"“那我可真是失礼了～在主菜面前稍微有点激动～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":221,"right":293,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":230,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:14","scriptId":790,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":230,"right":293,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":230,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:15","scriptId":790,"text":"（好浓烈的火药味，都快被呛晕了……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":230,"right":293,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-PROLOGUE:790:16","scriptId":790,"text":"“那就先说说这次军演的具体事项吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":293,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:1","scriptId":10780,"text":"“恩……我大致了解了，采用五局三胜制是吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":293,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:2","scriptId":10780,"text":"“没错，两场攻防战和三场夺旗战。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:3","scriptId":10780,"text":"“和一般军演内容没什么不同，唯一区别是没有补给。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":283,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":223,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:4","scriptId":10780,"text":"“看上去条件很苛刻啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:5","scriptId":10780,"text":"“战场上是会事先空投不少物资，除了达成胜利目标以外，如何收集物资、保证战线持续运作也是需要重点考虑的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":223,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":283,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:6","scriptId":10780,"text":"“模拟真正的战场，这才是军演的目的，不是吗～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":283,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":225,"speaker":"蕾贝卡·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:7","scriptId":10780,"text":"“恩，这种军演看来会很有看头，我很期待啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":225,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":221,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:8","scriptId":10780,"text":"（哼哼，这次演习一定会让伊莎贝尔大惊失色～）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":225,"right":221,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":293,"speaker":"伊莎贝尔·丘吉尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:9","scriptId":10780,"text":"（虽然是伏龙芝主场，但是结果也是一目了然的，哼哼，加上这次，要三连胜了～)","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":293,"right":221,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":252,"speaker":"雷娅·古德里安","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:10","scriptId":10780,"text":"“我最不适应这种明枪暗箭的气氛了……队长还真坐得住……”（小声）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":293,"right":252,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":237,"speaker":"露米娜·施泰特","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"111009-EPILOGUE:10780:11","scriptId":10780,"text":"“还好啦～我们就看看普莉玛她们怎么应对强敌吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-047.webp","left":237,"right":252,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["除了掌握战场的地形配置，自己旗下的钢舞姬实力如何也是需要完全了解的。","桑赫斯特小队已经到达……恩？还是先遣？","另一方面，伏龙芝会议室中的情况"]}
